[1, "a", True, "b", False, None]
---
allocated=13784‥19976/513‥726, peak=30‥1000
$0 = *[]x0:$1
$1 = *[]b0⸨0:b1; 1:False; 2:True; 3:None; 4:x0:String⸩
*/
